# Dashboard segment

**SSOT:** `dashboard-routes.ts`, `cache-tags.ts` (inside the app). Dashboard copy: `@repo/i18n` `dashboard.json`. **Mirror** a sibling feature when adding routes. Admin and organization manage nav lives in the sidebar only — no in-page subnav or shared section title.

**Writes:** `action/dashboard/…` → `auth.api`. **Reads:** `get-*.ts` + `'use cache'` + tags.

**Lists:** URL `list/` + `ListTable`; never ReUI DataGrid / TanStack Table for server pages.

**Detail (Read):** [docs/agents/dashboard.md](docs/agents/dashboard.md).
